<title>CANADA: Noranda Forest Inc Q4 shr turns to loss.</title>
<headline>Noranda Forest Inc Q4 shr turns to loss.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>fourth quarter ended Dec. 31</p>
<p>			    1996			    1995</p>
<p> Shr	   loss	C$0.16    profit	C$0.27</p>
<p> Net	   loss	24,000    profit	44,000</p>
<p> Revs		     554,000		  613,000</p>
<p>	   12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr	 profit	C$0.10    profit	C$1.32</p>
<p> Net	 profit	27,000    profit     215,000</p>
<p> Revs		   2,296,000		2,407,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE:Q4 results included a C$32 million or C$0.20 per share charge for the writedown of the Thorold, Ontario paper mill and other reorganization costs related to the speciality paper business.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
</text>
